Dataset Description
The dataset for this competition consists of historical sales records from a diverse network of retail stores across Romania. It is designed as a forecasting task, where each row represents the state of a specific product in a specific store on a given date. Your task is to predict the demand (units sold) for each (product-store-date) combination for the next 14 days.

Files
train.csv - the training set
test.csv - the test set
sample_submission.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format
Lifeline Medical Supply: Data Dictionary
Column Name	Data Type	Description
row_ID	A unique identifier for each (product-store-date) combination.	
date	The calendar date of the entry (YYYY-MM-DD).	
store_id	Unique identifier for each retail location.	
city	The city where the store is located (e.g., București, Cluj-Napoca, Iași).	
region	Geographic region (e.g., Muntenia, Transilvania, Moldova).	
product_id	Unique identifier for each product.	
product_name	The name of the product.	
category	The product category (e.g., Dairy, Bakery, Meat, Fruits).	
price	The current unit price of the product.	
loyalty_day	A boolean/indicator (0 or 1) for special "Loyalty Program" days where members get extra points or indirect benefits.	
is_holiday	Boolean flag (1 if the date is a Romanian National Holiday, 0 otherwise).	
holiday_name	The name of the holiday (e.g., "Paște", "Crăciun", "Sfântul Andrei"). Empty if is_holiday is 0.	
demand	(Target) The number of units sold on that day for the specific product and store.	
